# desc: 「통상 수행·자연히 얻어지는 구성」 논거에 기댄 판단은? (결손 obviousness-rationale)
# suite: pa
# monotone: up
# expect-min: 1
PREFIX pa:   <https://w3id.org/sdkb/pa/>
PREFIX pakr: <https://w3id.org/sdkb/pa/kr/>
SELECT DISTINCT ?j ?set
WHERE { ?j pa:supportedBy ?set . ?set pa:hasRationale pa:RationaleRoutinePractice . }
ORDER BY ?j
